         0.12.0 -> 0.13.0 (.github#1673, the coord-engine 0.13.0 release). TWO packed members move, and
         either one alone would oblige this republish:
           * `dist/dotnet/.config/dotnet-tools.json` — the engine pin, 0.12.0 -> 0.13.0. A hashed kit:
             source (#1077), which is why `engine-pin-coherence` cannot be cleared without paying this.
           * `.claude/skills/pnext-item` — its `references/command-contracts.md` is GENERATED from
