           * `FsggKitSkillRoots` drops to `.claude/skills;.agents/skills`, so a receiver's next
             materialize writes TWO roots instead of three.
           * `FsggKitRetiredSkillRoots` is new, and the materialize target now SWEEPS the kit's own
